      "x": 60,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 528.0,
      "height": 100.0,
      "text": "clock_was_set() -> on_each_cpu(retrigger_next_event)\ncan't run in interrupt context, so the leap path skipped it.\n\nThat night's fix:  date -s \"$(date)\"\nsettimeofday -> clock_was_set() -> offsets fresh again",
      "originalText": "clock_was_set() -> on_each_cpu(retrigger_next_event)\ncan't run in interrupt context, so the leap path skipped it.\n\nThat night's fix:  date -s \"$(date)\"\nsettimeofday -> clock_was_set() -> offsets fresh again",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
