      "x": 720,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 431.20000000000005,
      "height": 120.0,
      "text": "if (leap) clock_was_set_delayed();\n  -> flag + raise HRTIMER_SOFTIRQ\n  -> softirq calls clock_was_set()\n+ offsets refreshed on every hrtimer interrupt\n\nGoogle: smear instead (24 h linear, noon to noon)",
      "originalText": "if (leap) clock_was_set_delayed();\n  -> flag + raise HRTIMER_SOFTIRQ\n  -> softirq calls clock_was_set()\n+ offsets refreshed on every hrtimer interrupt\n\nGoogle: smear instead (24 h linear, noon to noon)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
